WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.368
-Hey, everyone.
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.369
My name's Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.370
Thank you so much for watching.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.738
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.907
Well, guys,
if you haven't heard already,

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.308
today we got some big news

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.111
from New York's
attorney general.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:14.647
-Just a few minutes ago,
my office filed a lawsuit

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:17.650
against the
National Rifle Association

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.154
to dissolve the organization
in its entirety.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.624
-Wow. The NRA,
as we know it, could be gone.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:26.258
Aww.
Thoughts and prayers.

00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:31.197
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.999
We'll work on helping,
but not now.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.601
It's just too soon.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.003
Yeah, right now, the NRA is
in so much trouble,

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:39.605
even Trump is afraid
to wish them well.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.807
When the news broke,
people were shocked,

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:44.109
mostly 'cause this had nothing
to do with Trump.

00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:46.145
They're like...
[ Robotically ] "Can't process

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:49.982
[ Laughter ]
news not involving Trump."

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:52.952
That's right, no more NRA,
no more Confederate flags.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.555
This is turning into the worst
year of Ted Nugent's life.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.090
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.360
[ As Nugent ]
Please, just let me
keep my truck nuts!

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.062
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.898
One of the biggest politicians
who received donations

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.600
from the NRA is
Senator Mitch McConnell.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.635
That probably explains why,
today, he was seen breathing

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:11.838
into his neck
like it was a paper bag.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:14.908
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:18.110
Well, after the news broke,
Trump was asked about the NRA

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:19.645
and here's what he had to say.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:23.516 line:0%
-I think the NRA
should move to Texas

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.352 line:0%
and lead a very good
and beautiful life.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.954
-Trump was like...
[ As Trump ] We have
to protect the NRA.

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:30.622
I want them to go
down to Disney World

00:01:30.622 --> 00:01:32.091
and set up an NRA bubble.

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.293
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.362
Speaking of the president,
his campaign wants to make

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.531
some changes
to the debate schedule.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.632
Normally, there's just three,

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.501
but check out
what they're proposing.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.503 line:0%
-The Trump campaign is asking
for a fourth presidential debate

00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:46.606 line:0%
to be held in the
first week of September,

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.775 line:0%
to get ahead of early voting.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:51.344
-Oh, my God. We're debating
about the debates?!

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:54.013
They haven't even started.
I'm already exhausted.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.715
At this point,
who even needs debates?

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:57.350
Who is undecided?

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.051
Who's tuning in like...?
"I wanna see

00:01:59.051 --> 00:02:00.920
what this Donald Trump
guy's all about.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.389
[ Laughter ]
Then I'll make my mind up.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:06.492
I need at least three debates.
[ Sniff ]

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:09.429
Haven't -- Haven't figured out
who I'm goin' for yet.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.163
Then, once I do,
after the third debate,

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:15.168
maybe the fourth one,
then I'll -- then I'll know.

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:16.936
Actually, I don't mind
another debate,

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.003
as long as it's just Trump

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:19.605
naming things he sees
in the room.

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:21.441
[ As Trump ]
Podium, moderator, Biden,

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:22.508
camera, TV.

00:02:22.508 --> 00:02:23.742
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:25.344
That's the last day
for that joke.

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:28.681
[ Laughter intensifies ]

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.650
Well, speaking
of the 2020 election,

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.785
it looks like Joe Biden's
whittled down his options

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.254
for vice president
to Senator Kamala Harris

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:36.689
and Susan Rice.

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:38.758
Here to comment is
Crystal Washington,

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:43.162 line:0%
The One Black Woman Joe Biden
Didn't Interview for VP.

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:44.464 line:0%
-Hi!
Hi, Jimmy!

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.698 line:0%
I can't talk long.

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:48.034 line:0%
Gotta keep my phone lines
and my Zoom lines open,

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:49.836 line:0%
'cause I'm waiting
for that veep call.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.404 line:0%
[ Both chuckle ]
-Hi, Crystal.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:54.073
You think you're gonna
get a call from Joe Biden?

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.374
-Oh, I know I am.

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:56.675
I'm a Black woman

00:02:56.675 --> 00:02:59.012
with a phone. I'm just
making sure my ringer's on.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:02.381
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:04.583
-Not to crush your dreams,
but I don't think you're

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:06.418
in the running
for vice president.

00:03:06.418 --> 00:03:08.888
-Ah, trust me, Jimmy.

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:10.489
My friend Corinne got a call,

00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:11.957
Monique got a DM,

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:14.193
and someone went to Leslie's
house with a gift basket.

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:16.461
It's only a matter
of time, Jimmy.

00:03:16.461 --> 00:03:17.930
-But don't you have to be

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.800
in public office
to be considered?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.369
-Jimmy, I have a suit!
I have one in blue.

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.471
I have one in red, when
I'm throwing shade,

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:28.107
and I'm more qualified
than ever.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:31.677
I can code switch
with the best of them. Look.

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:33.579
Oh, no Trump didn't!

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:35.181
I'll work on that.
-Yeah.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:37.550
Well, I hope he reaches out.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.351
Is your phone on?

00:03:39.351 --> 00:03:40.486
-On.

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.255
-Internet good?

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:43.723
-Bars.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.091
-Pager?

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:46.492
-What?

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:47.960
-Is your pager on?

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.796
-Who uses a pager?

00:03:50.796 --> 00:03:51.864
-Biden.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:54.167
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, good point, Jimmy.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:56.335
Old-school, ready.

00:03:56.335 --> 00:03:58.171
-Carrier pigeon?

00:03:58.171 --> 00:03:59.238
-She ready, too.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:00.739
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.739 --> 00:04:02.841
I'm sure I'll hear
sometime today.

00:04:02.841 --> 00:04:04.910
And, if that doesn't work out,
I have an offer

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.346
to retroactively join
the cast of "Friends."

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:08.981
[ Laughter ]
-[ Clap ] Well, congratulations.

00:04:08.981 --> 00:04:10.283
Crystal Washington, everybody.

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:14.587
[ Applause ]

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:16.188
Here's some more
big political news,

00:04:16.188 --> 00:04:18.424 line:0%
and it's not gonna make
the president happy.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:20.493 line:0%
-Manhattan district attorneys
have subpoenaed

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:23.162 line:0%
Donald Trump's long-time lender,
Deutsche Bank,

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.898 line:0%
for financial records related
to him and his company.

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:27.199
-In response, Trump was like...

00:04:27.199 --> 00:04:29.034
[ As Trump ] After all
the bankruptcies I've filed,

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:30.503
this is how they treat me?

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:32.171
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.772
How is a bank
still lending to Trump?

00:04:33.772 --> 00:04:36.709
It's like Avis renting cars
to Hobbs &amp; Shaw.

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:42.081
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:43.882
While Trump's trying
to put all this bad press

00:04:43.882 --> 00:04:45.551
behind him,
he's not helping himself.

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:49.121
During a speech today in Ohio,
he tried to talk about Thailand,

00:04:49.121 --> 00:04:50.890
but listen
to how he pronounced it.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.325
-Your foreign competitors
moved their factories

00:04:53.325 --> 00:04:58.330
to prevent a level playing field
and to avoid liability,

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.666
shifting production
to "Thighland"

00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:02.735
-Oh, God, no!
-and to Vietnam.

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:04.670
[ Laughter ]
-No. No.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:05.971
No.
-He says!

00:05:05.971 --> 00:05:07.173
-No.

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.540
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.076
-[ As Trump ]
To quote my good friend,

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:11.744
Thawmas the Thank Engine...

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:14.380
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.948
Meanwhile, last night,
Trump held

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.683
another coronavirus
press briefing

00:05:17.683 --> 00:05:22.221
and he accidentally called
Dr. Birx, "Dr. Burke," twice.

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:24.156
Well, to defend himself,
Trump put out this video.

00:05:24.156 --> 00:05:25.224
Check it out.

00:05:25.224 --> 00:05:27.092
-I'm Donald J. Trump,
here to talk

00:05:27.092 --> 00:05:30.763
about all my fantastic staffers,
whose names I totally know.

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:33.966 line:0%
Staffers like
Steve Munchkins.

00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:35.668 line:0%
Dr. Fakey.

00:05:35.668 --> 00:05:37.703 line:0%
Busty Divorcée.
[ Laughter until end ]

00:05:37.703 --> 00:05:39.938 line:0%
Ja-Rule Koosh ball.

00:05:39.938 --> 00:05:42.241 line:0%
KFC McDonald's.

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:44.043 line:0%
Loser DJ.

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:45.645 line:0%
John Goodman.

00:05:45.645 --> 00:05:47.312 line:0%
Hannibal Lecter.

00:05:47.312 --> 00:05:49.081 line:0%
The Smothers Brothers.

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:50.383 line:0%
And, of course,

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:52.551 line:0%
Mike Penis.
-Oh, no!

00:05:52.551 --> 00:05:54.420
[ Laughter ]
-What is he talking?

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.854
-KFC McDonald's.
-What is he talking?

00:05:55.854 --> 00:05:58.057
-No, no, Loser DJ.
That's the one.

00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:00.259
[ Laughter ]

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:02.195
He thinks the guy's name
is Loser DJ.

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:06.032
[ Laughter ]

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:07.533
Well, guys,

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:10.135
as the pandemic rolls on
with no end in sight,

00:06:10.135 --> 00:06:11.971
there's only one thing
everyone's looking for,

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:13.405 line:0%
but no one can find.

00:06:13.405 --> 00:06:16.476 line:0%
-Reuters has learned that
the shortage of Clorox wipes

00:06:16.476 --> 00:06:18.878 line:0%
likely will last into 2021.

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:20.213
-2021?!

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.814
Are they making these
or mining them

00:06:21.814 --> 00:06:24.783
from a mountain in Madagascar?
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.783 --> 00:06:27.453
That'll be in great in 2021,
when we have a vaccine

00:06:27.453 --> 00:06:29.455
and 10 billion
extra Clorox wipes!

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:30.523 line:0%
[ Striking palm ]

00:06:30.523 --> 00:06:32.024
Come on, Clorox, this is it!

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:33.559
This is your big moment!

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:36.028
If there were a dust pandemic,
you think Swiffer would be like,

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:37.263
"Ah, we'll get you next year"?

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:38.731
Swiffer would be on it!

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:41.434
[ Laughter ]

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:44.203
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:06:44.203 --> 00:06:46.572
-I'm sorry.

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:48.808
-Wiping your eye...
-I'm sorry!

00:06:48.808 --> 00:06:49.909
-...with the mask.

00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:52.979
[ Laughter ]
[ Clap ]

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:54.680
But people have been
keepin' busy during this.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.349
In fact,
Nintendo just reported...

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:03.222
You can tell Nintendo's
making a fortune

00:07:03.222 --> 00:07:05.958
'cause, in the latest game,
Mario spends an entire level

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:07.526
sitting on a gold bidet.

00:07:07.526 --> 00:07:08.828
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.828 --> 00:07:11.930
[ As Mario ]
This-a is the good life.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.467
Yep, Mario and Luigi
aren't even plumbers anymore.

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:15.601
Now, they're
on Martha's Vineyard

00:07:15.601 --> 00:07:17.403
with the Winklevoss twins.

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:20.506
[ Laughter ]

00:07:20.506 --> 00:07:22.674
[ Clap ]
[ Laughs, snorts ]

00:07:22.674 --> 00:07:24.443
And, finally, these days,
it can feel like

00:07:24.443 --> 00:07:25.711
there's a lot going wrong
in the world

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:27.446
and sometimes you just wish
you could make it right.

00:07:27.446 --> 00:07:29.849
Well, luckily we're able to do
that here at "The Tonight Show."

00:07:29.849 --> 00:07:31.684
It's time for
"This Week Made Right."

00:07:31.684 --> 00:07:32.751
Check it out.

00:07:32.751 --> 00:07:37.790
♪♪

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.526 line:0%
-And here's the Space X
shuttle splashing down.

00:07:40.526 --> 00:07:42.328 line:0%
Right now, Houston's
filling in the astronauts

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:43.528 line:0%
on what they missed
on Earth,

00:07:43.528 --> 00:07:46.165 line:0%
like coronavirus,
murder hornets,

00:07:46.165 --> 00:07:49.034 line:0%
"Mulan" costing $30
on Disney+.

00:07:49.034 --> 00:07:51.136 line:0%
And they're leaving.

00:07:51.136 --> 00:07:52.972 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
That checks out.

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:54.673 line:0%
-Welcome back.
This morning, Microsoft says

00:07:54.673 --> 00:07:58.243 line:0%
it is still discussing
a potential purchase of TikTok,

00:07:58.243 --> 00:08:00.145 line:0%
days after President Trump said

00:08:00.145 --> 00:08:02.615 line:0%
he might ban
the popular video app.

00:08:02.615 --> 00:08:03.782 line:0%
Joining me to discuss this,

00:08:03.782 --> 00:08:05.451 line:0%
assistant to the president
Peter Navarro.

00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:07.119 line:0%
Peter, thanks for taking
the time this morning.

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:08.688 line:0%
[ Disco plays ]

00:08:08.688 --> 00:08:11.790 line:0%
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:18.163 line:0%
♪♪

00:08:18.163 --> 00:08:20.499 line:15%
-That's right, three
stranded men were saved

00:08:20.499 --> 00:08:22.601 line:15%
after rescuers saw
their message in the sand.

00:08:22.601 --> 00:08:23.869 line:0%
Luckily, they chose a message

00:08:23.869 --> 00:08:26.205 line:0%
that really got the
search team's attention.

